* ============================================================
* Precision 7.05 V Reference Subsystem
*   ADR1399H buried-Zener reference (heated) + LTC6078 buffer
*   IN  = raw supply input node
*   OUT = buffered, low-impedance VREF output (1 k load)
* ============================================================

* ---------- Model libraries (genuine vendor models) ----------
.lib ADR1399.lib
.lib LTC6078.lib

* ---------- Raw supply ----------
VIN   IN   0   DC 15

* ---------- Zener bias network ----------
* Ibias = (15 V - 7.05 V) / 4.99k ~ 1.6 mA (within 0.5 mA...5 mA range)
R1    IN   VZ  4.99k
CREF  VZ   0   100n

* ---------- ADR1399H reference ----------
* Pin order: HEATER+  HEATER-  CATHODE(+)  ANODE(-)
XREF  IN   0    VZ    0   ADR1399H

* ---------- LTC6078 unity-gain buffer ----------
* Pin order: IN+  IN-  V+  V-  OUT
XBUF  VZ   OUT  IN    0   OUT  LTC6078

* ---------- Load ----------
RL    OUT  0   1k

* ---------- Analysis ----------
.tran 0 100m 0 10u
.meas TRAN vout_dc AVG V(OUT) FROM 90m TO 100m
.meas TRAN vref_raw AVG V(VZ) FROM 90m TO 100m
.meas TRAN iload AVG I(RL) FROM 90m TO 100m

.options plotwinsize=0 reltol=1e-4
.end
